# Tigreal, Warrior of Dawn

> Tigreal is not a tank you blind-pick because you want a front line. He is a bush-controlled initiation test: if the enemy draft cannot reliably cancel or cleanse his engage, one clean combo decides the fight. If they can, he turns into a predictable wall with a long cooldown problem.

