## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Conceal Flicker Pickoff (Roam)

- Items: Rapid Boots, Dominance Ice, Fleeting Time, Athena's Shield, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Fleeting Time, Athena's Shield
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Tough Boots over Rapid Boots when Use when layered crowd control can stop Tigreal before Sacred Hammer or Implosion completes.; Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against repeated magic poke or burn damage rather than one committed mage burst.; Guardian Helmet over Fleeting Time when Use when your team wins vision but Tigreal enters each Lord setup too low to threaten Flicker Implosion.
- Total cost: 11250 gold

Default ranked setup for hiding Tigreal's entry angle, chaining Conceal with Flicker, and resetting faster when a pick turns into an assist.

### Roam Frontline Encourage (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Radiant Armor, Guardian Helmet, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Guardian Helmet
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Rapid Boots over Tough Boots when Use when crowd control is light and Tigreal needs faster river-to-side-lane rotations.; Athena's Shield over Radiant Armor when Use against one-rotation magic burst that can punish Tigreal during the first half of Implosion.; Fleeting Time over Guardian Helmet when Use when your team reliably converts every Flicker engage into kills or assists.
- Total cost: 11380 gold

Grouped-fight setup for games where Tigreal must stand in front, absorb the first response, and give his carries Encourage value.

### Roam Anti-Physical Peel (Roam)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Dominance Ice, Blade Armor, Antique Cuirass, Athena's Shield, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Blade Armor, Antique Cuirass
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when the physical carries are protected by enough control that CC duration matters more than extra armor.; Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against sustained magic damage that follows Tigreal after he commits to peeling.; Oracle over Athena's Shield when Use when allied shields or healing keep Tigreal alive through repeated second-contact fights.
- Total cost: 11080 gold

Anti-physical variant for marksman or fighter-heavy drafts where Tigreal protects his carry first and only Flicker-starts when the back line is exposed.

